- text: 'My latest score (ID 86: 1.6861) shows a slight improvement over the previous SA attempt, but it''s still significantly below my best score of 2.163 (ID 31, simple hill climbing). This suggests that while the `compute_max_radii` iterations are important, the overall efficiency and effectiveness of the simulated annealing algorithm with its current parameters are not yet optimal. The system''s optimization tips also highlighted vectorization.


