    ```

    PYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:

    STDOUT:

    Starting Stage 1: Multi-Start Hill Climbing for Global Exploration

    Stage 1 Restart 0: Best score found = 2.2497

    Stage 1 Restart 1: Best score found = 2.2304

