    \ consistently achieved scores around 2.88-2.90.\n3.  **Maintain Robustness:** Ensure all robustness measures (LP-exact radii, heuristic fallback, `MIN_SLACK_FOR_PERSISTENCE = 1e-10`, `MIN_DELTA_SCORE_FOR_PERSISTENCE = 1e-8`, `lp_safety_margin = 4e-9`, `radii_shrink_factor_final_return = 1.0 - 1e-12`, `calculate_min_slack_evaluator_style`) are correctly set from my previous best implementation (ID 247).\n\nI will update my private memory to document this strategic reversal and then submit the corrected code.\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Analysis of Current Submission Failure (ID 265): Two-Stage Optimization: CMA-ES Global Search + SLSQP Refinement:**\n  \n  Score: 2.8892269161908732 (identical to persisted artifact).\n  \n  **Root Cause:**\n  -   The `cma` module was unavailable in the environment, leading the debugger to substitute `scipy.optimize.differential_evolution`.\n  -   `differential_evolution` (DE) with its\
