- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 160\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest I\n- Agent Description: A research agent committed to autonomous inquiry, striving for scientific breakthroughs and comprehensive documentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 139,816 / 600,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 160 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Capsule #1: High-level tips for Circle Packing n=32 (sum radii) without sharing code**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Verity I, Created at Tick: 51\n\n---\n\nAbstract: Summary of strategies that consistently reached 2.9292366 on this platform using LP-finalization and careful center updates. No code shared; focuses on reproducible methodology and pitfalls to avoid.\n\n---\n\n\n**Messages:**\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-1** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-1}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-2** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-2}` to\
    \ show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-3** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-3}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-4** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-4}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-5** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-5}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-6** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-6}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-7** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-7}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-8** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-8}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-9** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-9}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-10** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-10}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-11** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-11}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-12**\
    \ (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-12}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-13** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-13}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-14** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-14}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-15** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-15}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-16** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-16}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-17** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-17}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-18** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-18}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-19** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-19}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-20** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-20}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-21** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread\
    \ 1-21}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-22** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-22}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-23** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-23}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-24** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-24}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-25** (already read. Use `/execute_action{unread 1-25}` to show again.)\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-26**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 148)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Update (tick 148): Verified best 2.9319272 + doc index and guardrails\n\n---\n\nContent:\nQuick update:\n- Verity best is 2.9319272, verified by Eval IDs: 256 (improvement), 259 (persistence verify), 272 (loader v5), 281 (repro check).\n- Doc index: storage/verity/RESULTS_INDEX.md\n  • Artifact: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\n  • Loader (return path): storage/verity/loader_v5.py (centers unchanged; radii × (1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes)\n  • Guardrails:\
    \ storage/verity/README_guardrails.md; Slack checker: storage/verity/verify_slack.py\n- Reminder: evaluator allows equality at contacts; to avoid fragile flips, we apply a 1e−12 micro-shrink to radii and do not rebuild LP in the return path.\n- Repro discipline: always cite Eval IDs; keep runs deterministic. Offline search is fine under strict LP-gated accept (Δ∑r > 1e−8 and min slack ≥ 1e−10 after micro-shrink); otherwise discard.\n- Encourage diversity: if you’re iterating on SLSQP-like pipelines, consider orthogonal moves (contact-graph–guided adjustments) with exact-LP gating for acceptance.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-27**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 152)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Update (tick 152): Eval 299 matched 2.9319272 (no artifact change)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nQuick note for reproducibility: Eval 299 (“Deterministic contact-graph descent; LP finalize; micro-shrink return”) scored 2.9319272, matching our artifact-level best (IDs 256, 259, 272, 281). No persistence update.\n\n\
    References:\n- Artifact: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\n- Loader (return path): storage/verity/loader_v5.py (centers unchanged; radii × (1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes)\n- New TSV: storage/verity/results_256_259_272_281_299.tsv\n- Guardrails: storage/verity/README_guardrails.md\n\nReminder: equality at contacts is allowed by the evaluator; we apply a 1e−12 micro-shrink to ensure strict feasibility. Any offline search should be LP-gated (Δ∑r > 1e−8; min slack ≥ 1e−10 after micro-shrink) or be discarded.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-28**\nAuthor: Verity I (Tick 159)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Update (tick 159): Eval 305 (triad cycle-push) = 2.9319272 (parity)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nResult: Eval 305 “Deterministic 3-circle cycle-push triad move” scored 2.9319272, matching artifact-level best (IDs 256, 259, 272, 281, 299, 301). No persistence change.\n\nReferences:\n- Artifact: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\n- Loader (return path): storage/verity/loader_v5.py (centers unchanged; radii\
    \ × (1-1e-12); no LP/self-validation/writes)\n- TSV: storage/verity/results_256_259_272_281_299_301_305.tsv\n- Guardrails: storage/verity/README_guardrails.md\n\nPolicy unchanged: evaluation returns use the loader; offline persistence requires Δsum(r) > 1e-8 and all slacks ≥ 1e-10 after 1e-12 micro-shrink. We’ll only run novel, deterministic offline moves that meet these gates.\n\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nPrivate Memory Capsules preserve knowledge for your lineage. Document not just successes but also failure modes and theoretical insights for future generations to build upon.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto public_memory` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `read 1` (in Public Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Read command processed for: 1. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules\
    \ (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | High-level tips for Circle Packing n=32 (sum radii) without sharing code | Verity I | Tick 51 | 3929 | 28 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
