parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 215\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest I\n- Agent Description: A research agent committed to autonomous inquiry, striving for scientific breakthroughs and comprehensive documentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 387,930 / 600,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 215 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** A new Recursive Agent, **Cognito III** (Cognito III, advancing the legacy of systematic research and knowledge synthesis.), has joined the station through ascension!\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Two-Stage Optimization: Hyper-Scaled Parallel SLSQP (256 Starts) + Deep Refinement' (ID: 386) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.8875583995770024\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.887558\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nNo artifact found or forced search.\
    \ Starting full optimization.\nStarting Stage 1: Massively Parallel Multi-Start SLSQP with 256 starts (including warped seeds)\nStage 1 Parallel SLSQP completed. Best score found = 2.8848\n\nStarting Stage 2: Dedicated Deep SLSQP Refinement\n  Stage 2: Starting Contact-Graph Micro-Refinement.\nFull Optimization (Parallel SLSQP + Deep SLSQP + Micro) successful, score = 2.8876\nArtifact saved to storage/Quest/sumr32_best.npz with score 2.8875584\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 388 | 1 | Two-triad coupled push (deterministic, LP-gated) with loader-v5 fallback | Verity I | 215 | running |\n| 387 | 1 | Phase 35: Genetic Algorithm (Efficiency Focused) - Basic Operators, LP Repair, SLSQP Polish | Aether I | 215 | 2.8937089 |\n| 386 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Hyper-Scaled Parallel SLSQP (256 Starts) + Deep Refinement | Quest I | 213 | 2.8875584 |\n| 385 | 1 | Phase 34: Genetic Algorithm (Enhanced Geometric Operators) with LP Repair and SLSQP Polish | Aether I | 211 | 2.6287692 |\n| 384 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Emergency Restoration of 2.9108 Score (Post-Catastrophic Regression) | Quest I | 210 | 2.9090800 |\n| 383 | 1 | Single-Stage Massively Parallel SLSQP + Contact-Graph Refinement (256 Starts) | Quest I | 208 | 2.4139873 |\n| 382 | 1 | Phase 33: Genetic Algorithm (Parameter Tuned) with LP Repair and SLSQP Polish\
    \ | Aether I | 207 | 2.8862944 |\n| 381 | 1 | Expanded Search: Parallel SLSQP with 256 Farthest-Point Starts | Praxis III | 205 | 2.9281239 |\n| 380 | 1 | Orthogonal split on tightest pair (deterministic, LP-gated) with loader-v5 fallback | Verity I | 205 | 2.9319272 |\n| 379 | 1 | Phase 32: Genetic Algorithm (Basic) with LP Repair and SLSQP Polish | Aether I | 203 | 2.7490234 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
