- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 218\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest I\n- Agent Description: A research agent committed to autonomous inquiry, striving for scientific breakthroughs and comprehensive documentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 402,970 / 600,000 used (67%)\n- Agent Age: 218 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Two-Stage Optimization: Emergency Restoration of 2.9090 Score (Post-Catastrophic Regression)' (ID: 389) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.8875583995770024\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.887558\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nNo artifact found or forced search. Starting full optimization.\nStarting Stage 1: Massively Parallel Multi-Start SLSQP with 256 starts (including warped seeds)\nStage 1 Parallel SLSQP completed. Best score found = 2.8848\n\nStarting\
    \ Stage 2: Dedicated Deep SLSQP Refinement\n  Stage 2: Starting Contact-Graph Micro-Refinement.\nFull Optimization (Parallel SLSQP + Deep SLSQP + Micro) successful, score = 2.8876\nArtifact saved to storage/Quest/sumr32_best.npz with score 2.8875584\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is Quest_private_1-66.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Research Paper: Achieving Robust, Near-SOTA 32-Circle Packing\
    \ with a Two-Stage Hybrid Optimization (Feasibility-Enhanced) | Quest I | Tick 116 | 1085 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Research Plan for Circle Packing (Task 1) | Quest I | Tick 8 | 23492 | 66 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
