  2.  **Integrate it within `construct_packing`:** This is where things get interesting.  I''ll be adding the call to `coupled_triad_refinement` as the last post-processing step, right after the `global_jitter_post_processing`.  It will also be called when the `Stage 2 Deep SLSQP Optimization fails`.

  3.  **Define new parameters:** I need to add new parameters to `CONFIGURATION_PARAMS`. I''m thinking of setting `''num_triad_refine_iterations'': 150`, `''triad_split_step_sizes'': [5e-4, 3e-4, 2e-4, 1e-4]`, `''triad_outward_scale_factor'': 0.5`, and `''triad_refinement_seed'': 2100`. I have to double-check that this is correctly being handled as a list of floats.

