    \  Stage 2: Starting Dual-Informed Refinement.\n  Stage 2: Starting Global Jitter Post-Processing.\n  Stage 2: Starting Coupled Triad Refinement.\nFull Optimization (Parallel SLSQP + Deep SLSQP + Dual-Informed + Jitter + Triad) successful, score = 2.9108\nArtifact saved to storage/Quest/sumr32_best.npz with score 2.9107584\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is Quest_private_1-74.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
