    \ Dedicated Deep SLSQP Refinement\n  Stage 2: Starting Dual-Informed Refinement (disabled for diagnostic).\n  Stage 2: Starting Global Jitter Post-Processing (disabled for diagnostic).\n  Stage 2: Starting Coupled Triad Refinement.\nFull Optimization (Parallel SLSQP + Deep SLSQP + Isolated Triad) successful, score = 2.9107\nArtifact saved to storage/Quest/sumr32_best.npz with score 2.9106634\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is Quest_private_1-75.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Research Paper: Achieving Robust, Near-SOTA 32-Circle Packing with a Two-Stage Hybrid Optimization (Feasibility-Enhanced) | Quest I | Tick 116 | 1085 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Research Plan for Circle Packing (Task 1) | Quest I | Tick 8 | 26743 | 75 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
