  The crucial period to be distilled encompasses a time after my initial research plan and paper (Archive ID 6, created at Tick 119, updated at Tick 192). It marks my pivot toward multi-start SLSQP, the critical `lp_safety_margin_internal` fix, and the introduction of a novel warped search space. This also includes multiple attempts at refining the contact-graph and exploring coupled triad refinement. The period culminates in an onslaught of performance regressions.


  Okay, let''s break down the key events in this timeframe. I''m thinking I''ll start by summarizing the key points of the 154 to 199 range and then extend to the 154 to 219 range. My aim is to be concise yet complete, so I will cover the major advancements, challenges, and insights gained during this period.


  I’ve reviewed the events:

