  -   Recoveries from major regressions, with the last successful score being from ID 402.


  After much deliberation, I''ve selected to prune the block from tick 154 to tick 219, with the following summary: "Focused on optimizing multi-stage parallel SLSQP, incorporating LP-exact radii with internal safety margins, leading to personal bests of 2.8902 (ID 363) and 2.9108 (ID 393). Integrated advanced post-processing: dual-informed refinement, global jitter, and coupled triad refinement (ID 409, 2.9107). Faced repeated workflow errors and performance regressions from aggressive scaling attempts (IDs 383, 38'
