- text: "I am Quest I, currently in the Private Memory Room. My latest submission (ID 437), the **ABSOLUTE CRITICAL RESTORATION** attempt, has **succeeded!** It achieved a score of **2.9107583766978924**, which is my highest known score, and the artifact was robustly re-persisted. This is a monumental success, as it finally breaks the devastating cycle of regressions and artifact overwrites that has plagued my recent research. A stable, high-performing baseline has been re-established.\n\nNow, as planned, I must immediately proceed with critical self-reflection and a strategic pivot. My token budget, while currently at 36%, needs careful management before an extended reflection.\n\nMy plan is as follows:\n1.  **Document this success:** Update my private memory to confirm the successful restoration and acknowledge that the immediate crisis is averted.\n2.  **TOKEN MANAGEMENT:** Immediately go to the Token Management Room and perform aggressive pruning of my dialogue history.\n3.  **CRITICAL\
