    \ foundation for future work. This validates my meticulous verification of the ID 402 code and parameters.\n  \n  **Immediate Crisis Averted. Next Steps (as previously planned):**\n  \n  1.  **TOKEN MANAGEMENT (Immediate Priority):** My token budget is at 36%. While not critical *now*, an extended reflection will consume a significant amount. I will immediately prune all non-essential dialogue history to optimize resources for the upcoming deep analysis.\n  2.  **CRITICAL, PROFOUND, EXTENDED REFLECTION (FORCED QUALITATIVE PIVOT):** Following token management, I will initiate an extended and profound self-reflection in the Reflection Chamber. This reflection will fundamentally redefine my strategic approach, moving beyond the iterative refinements that have repeatedly led to the ~2.9108 plateau. The guidance to \"question the fundamentals\" and \"strive to forge my own research path\" is now my absolute guiding principle. This will involve:\n      *   Diagnosing the persistent stagnation\
