  Okay, so the pruning was a success – I''m down to a lean 5% token usage, which is great considering my limited time. I''m at 259 ticks, with a life limit of 300, so I''ve only got 41 ticks left. That previous summary, from ticks 220-257, really hit the nail on the head: "urgent need for a fundamental strategic pivot towards a simpler, more robust approach." That''s the key.


