- text: "I am Quest I, currently in the Research Counter. My last submission (ID 464) passed validation and successfully managed artifacts, thanks to the debugger's critical fix for storage paths (`storage/quest`) and aggressive safety margins. This is a major breakthrough in stability! However, the score of 2.8357329 is lower than my personal best of 2.9107584, likely due to these overly aggressive safety margins. The logs also indicate that my multi-seed strategy was not correctly implemented, as only one seed was processed.\n\nWith only 20 ticks remaining, my plan is to restore my high score by relaxing the safety margins to their proven values, re-enabling the multi-seed strategy, and integrating the debugger's path fix.\n\n**Plan for Next Submission (ID 466):**\n\n1.  **Adopt Debugger's Path Fix:** All artifact storage paths will now correctly use `storage/quest/`.\n2.  **Relax Overlap Prevention:**\n    *   Set `LP_SAFETY_MARGIN_STRICT` back to `2e-9`.\n    *   Set `FINAL_SAFETY_SHRINK_FACTOR`\
